stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> RESERVED: booking created\nresources reserved

    RESERVED --> CONFIRMED: confirm\n[expires_at > now]
    RESERVED --> EXPIRED: expiry worker\n[expires_at <= now]
    RESERVED --> CANCELLED: customer/operator cancel\n[expires_at > now]

    EXPIRED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]

    note right of RESERVED
      Confirm, expire, and cancel use
      conditional UPDATE WHERE status = RESERVED.
      Confirm also requires expires_at > NOW().
      Exactly one racer changes the row.
    end note

    note right of CONFIRMED
      Inventory remains consumed.
      No transition back to RESERVED.
    end note
